  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "Python程式設計",
    "sub_ename": "PROGRAMMING WITH PYTHON",
    "describe_ch": "Python是目前最廣泛被使用的語言之一，除了設計簡潔、語法易讀易懂、學習曲線相對較低的優點以外，它可以應用於各種不同的領域，包括科學、數據分析、人工智能、網路開發等。本課程透過線上非同步的方式來講授課程，除了可以讓學生有彈性的時間空間進行學習外，也可以反覆的複習。課程主要範圍包含：Python程式語言簡介;程式的基本結構與運算;邏輯運算;集合物件;函式;資料處理;物件導向設計;使用者體驗設計等。",
    "describe_eh": "Python is currently one of the most widely used programming languages. In addition to its concise design, easy-to-read syntax, and relatively low learning curve, it can be applied to various fields, including science, data analysis, artificial intelligence, and web development. This course is taught through online asynchronous learning, which allows students to have flexible time and space for learning and review. The course covers the following topics: basic program structure and operations; logical operations; collection objects; functions; data processing; object-oriented design; and user experience design.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
