      "describe_en": "Learn to solve problems by python"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "學習如何應用程式分析開放資料",
      "describe_en": "Learn to analyze open data by python"
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "培養透過網路自學之能力",
      "describe_en": "Cultivate the ability of self-learning through the Internet;"
    }
